Subject: [PATCH v2 07/27] crypto: s5p - switch to skcipher API
Date:   Thu, 24 Oct 2019 15:23:25 +0200
Message-Id: <20191024132345.5236-8-ard.biesheuvel@linaro.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.20.1
